# Docs excluded from the in-app About reader (AzNavRail footer).
# The reader auto-discovers every .md in the repo root and docs/; these are
# developer/internal docs that aren't useful to end users in-app.
# README.md and PRIVACY.md are intentionally NOT listed — they belong in About.

# Developer build/setup guide.
docs/BUILDING.md

# Internal backlog / roadmap.
docs/TODO.md

# Historical record of the prompts that generated the app.
docs/ORIGINAL_PROMPTS.md

# Surfaced in-app through their own dedicated menu items (Tutorial / FAQ),
# which fetch these same files — listing them in About too would be redundant.
docs/TUTORIAL.md
docs/FAQ.md

# Internal strategy notes (market/financial/roadmap) — for the maintainer, not
# end users. Kept in-repo but never surfaced in-app.
docs/strategy/MARKET.md
docs/strategy/FINANCIAL.md
docs/strategy/ROADMAP.md
